   3:Core/Src/ws2812_uart.c ****   * @file           : ws2812_uart.c
   4:Core/Src/ws2812_uart.c ****   * @brief          : GL5050RGB01H-T via USART3 @ 4 Mbaud + TX inversion + DMA
   5:Core/Src/ws2812_uart.c ****   * @details        : One normal DMA transfer sends exactly one LED frame.
   6:Core/Src/ws2812_uart.c ****   *                   TX inversion makes the UART idle state a WS2812 reset low.
